# rows-zero-scale (H4): 0 typed into b's field with a=2 set — Enter puts the
# old value back ("1.00") and the URL keeps a=2 with no b.
# Coordinates are this tree's (the function card is 104 tall without
# the readout): row a/k/b/h at y 277/321/382/426. h4-readout grows the
# function card by 133.5, landing rows at the reference y; flip back then.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query a=2
wait 2000
click 331 404
wait 150
key a ctrl
wait 100
type "0"
wait 200
key Enter
wait 400
shot rows-zero-scale
